  "prefLabel": "Pas 204.12 Decision of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pas 204.12 Decision of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 225-A:20, the board shall:\n\n(a) Present written findings to the commissioner;\n\n(b) Make such order as the facts require.\n\nSource. #8132, eff 7-30-04; renumbered by #14144-A (formerly Pas 204.11)",
